        "slc_bc42a02cad1a89cc4ea1ab12ef057bbf74f812f5d16059ba765c833c98be6f78"
      ],
      "text": "An /add command lets users preload a single file or an entire directory (with smart filtering) into conversation context, complementing the AI's automatic file reading."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8d719611548e97507af863eb63b7345df2535ce2844445e091bc489b84fc8f8e",
